From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cappy Ishihara <cappy@cappuchino.xyz>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm: sun4i: configure TCON-TOP mux for DSI

The DSI encoder path configured the TCON CPU interface but skipped
sun4i_tcon_set_mux(). That prevented the existing sun8i TCON-TOP hook from
programming PORT_SEL for the mixer-to-LCD1 route.

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun4i_tcon.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun4i_tcon.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun4i_tcon.c
@@ -807,3 +807,4 @@
 		sun4i_tcon0_mode_set_cpu(tcon, encoder, mode);
+		sun4i_tcon_set_mux(tcon, 0, encoder);
 		break;
 	case DRM_MODE_ENCODER_LVDS:
